,079 \r\nhttps://www.google.com/url?q=https%3A%2F%2Fvk.cc%2Fc2JnRF&sa=D&sntz=1&usg=AFQjCNE4usgK_TRXvziyBdhyHX5CrW7Szw', '2021-06-14 10:15:11', '2021-06-14 10:15:11'),
