ct us even on the 14th day to return the purchased product and we will refund your money on the product and shipping, and the shipping fee for returning the product, we also pay it.\r\n\r\nYou can order directly from the official www.serenicapelli.ie website\r\n\r\nP.S. Do not reply to this message, it will not get anywhere.\r\nFor any questions you have, please contact us through the official website.\r\n\r\nThank you.', '2021-07-08 10:38:28', '2021-07-08 10:38:28'),
